やっぱり、こうすると余計にカネがかかる…","nextNodeIds":[230190102]},{"nodeId":230190102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3051833242,"text":"なんの話？","nextNodeIds":[230190103]},{"nodeId":230190103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1883791946,"text":"あ、どうも。いま船を設計しているところなんだが…壁にぶつかってしまってね。","nextNodeIds":[230190104]},{"nodeId":230190104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":781704778,"text":"簡単に言うと、製造コストを上げずに船の積載量を増やしたいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[230190105]},{"nodeId":230190105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":967150930,"text":"重量が大きくなると、船が壊れやすくなる。重量が不均一な状態では、バランスに問題が出る…","nextNodeIds":[230190106]},{"nodeId":230190106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1104990194,"text":"一番効果的な解決方法は、より良い材料を使うことだ。だがそうなると…製造コストが問題になってくる…","nextNodeIds":[230190107]},{"nodeId":230190107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1884143066,"text":"はぁ…ぶっちゃけた話、カネはないけど、いい船が作りたいってだけの話さ。","nextNodeIds":[230190108]},{"nodeId":230190108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1680602738,"text":"だからカネの代わりに、技術で問題を解決できないかと思ってね。","nextNodeIds":[230190109]},{"nodeId":230190109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2601948146,"text":"そんなこと本当にできるの…","nextNodeIds":[230190110]},{"nodeId":230190110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":272116146,"text":"ハハハッ。信じてもらえないかもしれないが、そういう前例はいくらでもある。","nextNodeIds":[230190111]},{"nodeId":230190111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":3588827306,"text":"俺たちの造る船は、荒波にさらされることのない近海漁船ばかりだしな。","nextNodeIds":[230190112]},{"nodeId":230190112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":2496052538,"text":"みんなケチるとこはケチって、修理しながら使うってのを前提に船を造ってる…なんとか使えたら、それでいいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[230190113]},{"nodeId":230190113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":2361291882,"text":"ま…そのお陰で、俺たち船の修理工は毎日大忙しだけどな。","nextNodeIds":[230190114]},{"nodeId":230190114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":3593350146,"text":"旅人、できたらあそこに行って、帰港したばかりの船を調べてくれないか？日頃の過積載が祟ってトラブルが起きてるように見える。","nextNodeIds":[230190115]},{"nodeId":230190115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":407759490,"text":"さっき悩んでた問題も、そこにヒントがあるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[230190116,230190118]},{"nodeId":230190116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4248662650,"text":"任せて。","nextNodeIds":[230190117]},{"nodeId":230190117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1627425426,"text":"じゃ、頼んだぞ！俺は急いで他の船の修理に行かないと…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230190118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1092268114,"text":"なんで自分で行かないの？","nextNodeIds":[230190119]},{"nodeId":230190119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":1029000746,"text":"行きたいのは山々だが、網を引き上げにすぐ出航したいって船がいてな。そいつの修理をしなきゃならねえ…","nextNodeIds":[230190120]},{"nodeId":230190120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4032,"speakerName":"ラフィク","textMapHash":2571872530,"text":"だから旅人、君に頼むしかないんだ！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2301901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4032 "],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_